fleetlayer-signin (plugins/signin) depends on webauthn-rs, webauthn-rs-core and webauthn-rs-proto
(https://github.com/kanidm/webauthn-rs), under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, used unmodified as libraries; their
source is available there. No MPL code is copied into Fleetlayer's own files. Its tests use webauthn-authenticator-rs
from the same project, also MPL-2.0 and unmodified.

Through webauthn-rs-core, fleetlayer-signin's release binary includes OpenSSL (https://www.openssl.org), built from
source and linked statically, under the Apache License 2.0.

fleetlayer-cookies (plugins/cookies) depends on the psl crate (https://github.com/addr-rs/psl, MIT or Apache-2.0),
which carries data from the Public Suffix List (https://publicsuffix.org), under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, used
unmodified. No MPL code is copied into Fleetlayer's own files.

fleetlayer-matrix (plugins/matrix) depends on matrix-sdk (https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-rust-sdk, Apache
License 2.0), which brings in as_variant, eyeball, eyeball-im, imbl, imbl-sized-chunks, readlock and readlock-tokio,
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, used unmodified as libraries; their source is available from crates.io. No MPL
code is copied into Fleetlayer's own files. Its release binary includes SQLite (public domain), built from source.

